WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.300
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.601
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.000
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.434
The Pentagon this week described
the unidentified object

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:11.701
shot down over Canada
on Saturday

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:14.601
as a, "small, metallic balloon."

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:17.534
So, it was either a dire
national security threat

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:20.534
or a wasted 25 cents
at a county fair.

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:21.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.200
"Hold on to that, Tyler --
Oh, son of a gun."

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.467
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.467
President Biden is reportedly
considering making

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:29.067
a national televised address

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.501
to discuss the recent
unidentified flying objects.

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.234
Oh, yeah,
definitely please do that.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.133
Interrupt
an episode of "The Voice"

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:38.667
and walk 30 yards down that
long red carpet to a podium

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.167
like Obama did
when we got bin Laden,

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.434
and tell the American people
you popped some balloons.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:44.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:46.634
"My fellow Americans,
it's true what they say.

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:49.300
Once you pop,
you just can't stop."

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.033
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.868
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:56.133
that Air India will purchase
more than 200 planes from Boeing

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:59.400
while Frontier is buying
200 planes from Goodwill.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.601
During the White House
press briefing yesterday,

00:01:04.601 --> 00:01:06.067
a reporter from Newsmax

00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.567
asked Press Secretary
Karine Jean-Pierre,

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.734
"is President Biden woke?"

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:13.968
And she rolled her eyes so hard,
they didn't come back.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:21.567
More haunting
than I think we planned.

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:23.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.067
President Biden said yesterday

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.067
that the back and forth
with Republicans

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:28.601
in his State of the Union
address

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:31.467
made him feel like he was,
"Back on the playground."

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:34.200
"So jealous," said Matt Gaetz.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.801
Senator Ted Cruz
told reporters yesterday

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:44.801
that he plans to run
for a third term.

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:48.067
Cruz said he discussed it with
his family, and they insisted.

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:51.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:54.701
The company Volt Candy
has issued a recall

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:58.801
for its PrimeZEN Black 6000
male enhancement pill,

00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:01.267
because it contains
two unapproved drugs.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.133
Yeah, something tells me
the people who bought that

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:04.267
don't keep their receipts.

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:05.701
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:08.300
I think they're going to have to
eat the $9.95.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:12.200
And it doesn't matter
how I know how much it costs.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.667
Two for $18.

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:20.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.501
The fast-food chain Chipotle
has announced plans

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:25.968
to open a new brand called
Farmesa Fresh Eatery,

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:28.100
which will focus on
farm-to-table cuisine

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.367
as opposed to their usual
table to restroom.

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:33.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.701 --> 00:02:38.868
A Philadelphia Eagles fan was
arrested on Sunday in Florida

00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:41.133
after he allegedly
broke into a firehouse,

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.634
peed on the carpet, stole a hat,

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:45.667
and threw a knife
at a firefighter.

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:48.901
And then...
he found out the Eagles lost.

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:53.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:55.167
And finally,
a Florida city councilman

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:56.234
was arrested over the weekend

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:57.734
after authorities
allegedly found

00:02:57.734 --> 00:02:59.767
10 grams of cocaine in his shoe.

00:02:59.767 --> 00:03:01.601
Police first became suspicious

00:03:01.601 --> 00:03:04.033
when someone in Florida
was wearing shoes.

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:07.467
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:09.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
We are off and running.

